# Docker build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (kaboom-web on Railway).
# Allow-list: everything is excluded unless named here, so keypairs/, .env*,
# target/, pinocchio/, records and other operator files never reach an image.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/web
!packages
# npm ci validates every workspace in the lockfile, so their manifests ship.
!apps/realtime/package.json
!tests/sdk/package.json
!tests/anchor/package.json
# Migrations (preDeployCommand: node db/migrate.mjs) and the one-shot copy.
!db
# Read at runtime by the invariants cron pass.
!scripts/known-corruption-allow.txt

# Re-exclude inside the allowed folders.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.env*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/Dockerfile
